OpenJev Multimodal is an independent implementation, not affiliated with TypeSafe.
It does not include TypeSafe's proprietary Jev model or guarantee identical predictions.

References:
- TypeSafe public SystemOne API: https://docs.typesafe.ai/api
- ekzhang/openjev-sglang: https://github.com/ekzhang/openjev-sglang
- AlexWortega/openjev: https://huggingface.co/AlexWortega/openjev
- Discussion: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49752041

The implementation is original. The referenced SGLang repository had no license
file at inspection and its source was not copied into this project.

Qwen model weights, GGUF conversions, datasets, llama.cpp and software dependencies
retain their respective licenses. See model cards, lockfiles and the benchmark
manifest. No weights or benchmark question text are distributed here.

The chart and replay GIF contain only this project's actual model results.
